## Phase 4 — Ambulance Driver Dashboard

**Mobile-first, simple, mission-focused.**

### 4.1 — My Active Mission View
- `GET /api/emergencies/{emergencyId}` → show assigned emergency details
- Emergency location on map with route line to it
- ETA countdown based on current position + OSRM distance
- Status: "ASSIGNED → ON_ROUTE → ARRIVED → COMPLETED"

### 4.2 — Location Updates (fix existing simulation)
The current `simulation.js` posts to `localhost:8085/tracking/location` directly without auth. Fix it to:
- Post to `http://localhost:8080/api/tracking/location` (via gateway)
- Include `Authorization: Bearer <token>` header
- Works for both real GPS (future) and simulated movement now

### 4.3 — Simple Map View
Stripped-down map showing only:
- Their own ambulance position (no clutter from other ambulances)
- Route line to the emergency
- Progress indicator (same as current InfoPanel but fullscreen)

