## Phase 5 — Real-Time Updates Across All Dashboards

### 5.1 — Authenticated WebSocket
Current WebSocket connects to `localhost:8085/ws-sockjs` directly, no auth header. Fix:
- Connect through gateway WebSocket route: `ws://localhost:8080/ws/ws-sockjs`
- Pass JWT as a query param or STOMP header: `stompClient.connectHeaders = { Authorization: 'Bearer ' + token }`

### 5.2 — Emergency Status Updates via WebSocket
Currently only ambulance location is pushed over WebSocket. You should also push emergency status changes so dispatchers see `PENDING → ASSIGNED → COMPLETED` in real-time without polling. This requires a small backend addition: publish to a `/topic/emergencies` STOMP topic from `EmergencyStatusListener`.

