## Recommended Tech Stack for Rebuild

Stay with React (you're already there) but add:

| Need | Library | Why |
|------|---------|-----|
| Routing | `react-router-dom v6` | Role-based route protection |
| State | React Context + `useReducer` | Auth state, no localStorage needed |
| UI components | Tailwind CSS (CDN) | Already configured in your artifacts |
| Notifications | Custom toast component | Simple, no extra dep |
| HTTP client | Native `fetch` with interceptor wrapper | Already works |

No need for Redux — React context is sufficient for auth state + ambulance data.

